---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Statement | Revive Healthcare"
  description="How Revive Healthcare Providers collects, uses, shares and protects the information you give us through the waitlist sign-up form."
>
  <LegalPage title="Privacy Statement" effectiveDate="2026-11-10">
    <p>
      At Revive Healthcare Providers, we value your trust and are committed to protecting your personal
      information. This Privacy Statement explains how we collect, use, share, and protect your information when
      you complete our waitlist and outreach sign-up form to learn more about our Direct Primary Care (DPC)
      services.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit an inquiry or sign up to receive an outreach call or message from our clinical team, we
      collect the following details provided in the form:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Personal Contact Details:</strong> Name, email address, mobile phone number, and ZIP code.</li>
      <li><strong>Membership Information:</strong> Selected membership type (e.g., individual, family).</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Employer Information (if applicable):</strong> Company name and employee count for
        employer-sponsored membership inquiries.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Site Metrics:</strong> How you heard about us, the campaign link that brought you to our site (if
        any), and when you signed up.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information collected from our waitlist form strictly to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Contact you directly to discuss our DPC practice membership options, answer questions, and assist with
        enrollment.
      </li>
      <li>Determine service eligibility and regional coverage based on your ZIP code.</li>
      <li>Evaluate employer wellness partnership needs.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <strong>Access Controls:</strong> Your information is accessible only to authorized practice personnel,
      clinical staff, and designated enrollment coordinators involved in managing practice outreach. We do not
      sell or rent your personal data to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Email and Text Messages (SMS)</h2>
    <p>
      By providing your phone number and email address on the sign-up form, you explicitly consent to receive
      communications from Revive Healthcare Providers regarding your inquiry.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Message Frequency:</strong> Message frequency varies depending on your interactions with us and
        your preferred onboarding timeline.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Text Message (SMS) Opt-Out:</strong> You may opt out of receiving text messages at any time by
        replying STOP to any SMS from us.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Email Opt-Out:</strong> You may unsubscribe from outreach emails by clicking the “Unsubscribe” link
        at the bottom of any email or by replying directly with your request.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Note:</strong> Standard message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile carrier.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Information Sharing and Service Providers</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell, trade, or transfer your personal information to outside marketers. We share your data only
      with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our practice website and conducting
      outreach, including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Form &amp; Web Hosting Providers:</strong> Secure platforms that process form submissions.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Communication &amp; Messaging Platforms:</strong> Email delivery services used to facilitate
        practice outreach.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Website Analytics:</strong> Basic, privacy-focused web analytics services that help us measure
        website traffic and form performance.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      All third-party vendors are bound by strict confidentiality obligations and are permitted to process your
      data solely to perform services on our behalf.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Your Choices &amp; Data Rights</h2>
    <p>You retain control over your personal data. You have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you.</li>
      <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request that we update or correct inaccurate details.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Deletion:</strong> Request that we permanently delete your contact details and waitlist record from
        our systems.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the information provided below. We will fulfill
      your request in accordance with applicable laws.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Statement or our data privacy
      practices, please reach out to us at:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Practice Name:</strong> Revive Healthcare Providers</li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:office@rhcproviders.com">office@rhcproviders.com</a></li>
    </ul>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
